<title>USA: TABLE - Fed sets money supply targets for 1997/98.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fed sets money supply targets for 1997/98.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve set the following target ranges for growth of monetary and credit aggregates in its semi-annual report to Congress</p>
<p>			Actual	    Target	     Target</p>
<p>			 1996		1997		 1998</p>
<p>			     (Percent change Q4 to Q4)</p>
<p>   M2		  4.7	    1.0 to 5.0	 1.0 to 5.0</p>
<p>   M3		  6.8	    2.0 to 6.0	 2.0 to 6.0</p>
<p>   Debt		5.4	    3.0 to 7.0	 3.0 to 7.0</p>
</text>
